notes: The owner explicitly requested V028 while V027 had not been separately accepted, so V027 is recorded as the previous version while the owner-confirmed passed baseline remains V024 / 0_2_4. V028 preserves/restores the intended V027 bounded cooperative network simulator and adds a fourth Pedestrian-aware Cooperative mode. It tracks pedestrian request age, synthetic crossing occupancy and service sessions; may request earlier protected pedestrian service after a configurable maximum wait; may extend active pedestrian WALK/CLEAR for bounded crossing-clearance reserve; and prevents neighbour cooperation from shortening pedestrian phases while waiting or crossing demand is active. Fixed, Independent Adaptive, Cooperative Adaptive, and Pedestrian-aware Cooperative receive the same seeded exogenous demand. Emergency priority remains inactive. Physical/public-road traffic control remains disabled.
